OL,13,     FHouse with a terrifying aerobatic 
OL,14,     Fflight. The next day the duo head 
OL,15,     Fout of the city towards the       
OL,16,     Fbeautiful Blue Mountains, but once
OL,17,     Fagain, Brad's fear of heights is  
OL,18,     Fput to the test when they take a  
OL,19,     Fride on what turns out to be an   
OL,20,     Fextreme cable car                 
